on Description is currently not available. Cookie p-partnerinfo Duration 1 year Description Description is currently not available. Cookie ai_session Duration 1 hour Description This is a unique anonymous session identifier cookie set by Microsoft Application Insights software to gather statistical usage and telemetry data for apps built on the Azure cloud platform. Cookie _gcl_au Duration 3 months Description Google Tag Manager sets the cookie to experiment advertisement efficiency of websites using their services. Cookie _fbp Duration 3 months Description Facebook sets this cookie to display advertisements when either on Facebook or on a digital platform powered by Facebook advertising after visiting the website. Cookie 3060738.3440491 Duration 1 year 1 month 4 days Description No description available. Cookie __Secure-ROLLOUT_TOKEN Duration 6 months Description YouTube sets this cookie to manage feature rollout and experimentation. It helps Google control which new features or interface changes are shown to users as part of testing and staged rollouts, ensuring consistent experience for a given user during an experiment. Cookie affirm-csrf-token Duration session Description No description available. Cookie NavLocation_MSUCONTED Duration session Description Description is currently not available. Cookie RT Duration 7 days Description Akamai Boomerang set this cookie, which gauges visitor experience with page load times. Cookie _gat_UA-* Duration 1 minute Description Google Analytics sets this cookie for user behaviour tracking. Cookie mp_*_mixpanel Duration 1 year Description Mixpanel sets this cookie to determine how users use the website so that a good user experience can be provided. Cookie sa-user-id-v4 Duration 1 year Description Description is currently not available. Cookie *_oeu* Duration 6 months Description Optimizely sets this cookie to help analyse how users interact with the website during a single session. It tracks activity such as navigation patterns, scroll behaviour and interaction timing. Cookie AMP_* Duration 1 year Description Amplitude user session cookie that stores user and session information, suffixed with the first 10 characters of the project’s API key. Cookie AMP_MKTG_* Duration 1 year Description Amplitude marketing campaign cookie that stores campaign attribution information, suffixed with the first 10 characters of the project’s API key. Performance Performance cookies are used to understand and analyze the key performance indexes of the website which helps in delivering a better user experience for the visitors. Cookie _gat Duration 1 minute Description Google Universal Analytics sets this cookie to restrain request rate and thus limit data collection on high-traffic sites. Cookie AWSALB Duration 7 days Description AWSALB is an application load balancer cookie set by Amazon Web Services to map the session to the target. Cookie sync_active Duration Never Expires Description This cookie is set by Vimeo and contains data on the visitor's video-content preferences, so that the website remembers parameters such as preferred volume or video quality. Cookie dtCookie Duration session Description This cookie is set by the provider Dynatrace. This is a session cookie used to collect information for Dynatrace. Its a system to track application performance and user errors. Cookie AKA_A2 Duration 1 hour Description This cookie is set by Akamai. This cookie is used for DNS Prefetch and HTTP2 Push. It helps in improving the performance. Cookie GCLB Duration session Description This cookie is known as Google Cloud Load Balancer set by the provider Google. This cookie is used for external HTTPS load balancing of the cloud infrastructure with Google. Advertisement Advertisement cookies are used to provide visitors with customized advertisements based on the pages you visited previously and to analyze the effectiveness of the ad campaigns. Cookie barometric[cuid] Duration 1 year Description Claritas sets this c